      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know... i've never thought about it like that before. i always thought leaving meant giving up, but you're saying it's about taking control instead? like, instead of letting them grind me down until there's nothing left, i'm actually making a choice? \n\nit sounds so heavy though. when you say \"take that final step,\" it feels so permanent. i'm just so scared and so incredibly tired. is that really what you mean? that the only way to be a survivor is to just... stop?",
